WEBVTT

00:13.028 --> 00:16.231
You brought your tray and silver plate. You

00:16.251 --> 00:19.774
thought you'd open up the gate. You showed me

00:19.794 --> 00:24.018
powder on a glass. You thought you had a man of

00:24.058 --> 00:28.522
class. It was just, it was just a lie. So I wiped it

00:28.562 --> 00:32.126
clean and I watched you die. You called it art.

00:32.246 --> 00:35.529
You called it style. It was just garbage in a

00:35.569 --> 00:36.630
filthy pile.

00:40.247 --> 00:43.728
You held your clipboard like a gun You thought

00:43.748 --> 00:47.349
the battle was already won You crossed the line,

00:47.369 --> 00:50.189
you showed your hand You'll never ever

00:50.469 --> 00:54.910
understand It was just, it was just a lie So I

00:54.970 --> 00:58.491
wiped it clean and I watched you die You called it

00:58.691 --> 01:02.452
art, you called it style It was just garbage in a

01:02.472 --> 01:03.432
filthy pile

01:26.927 --> 01:32.030
It was just, it was just a lot, so I was clean and I

01:32.070 --> 01:35.772
was to die. You call it art, cause you're a fake.

01:35.892 --> 01:38.854
It was just garbage. Make more mistakes!

